%% Simplified duel transaction trace.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Judge
    participant C as Blazor WASM
    participant B as BFF (cookie check)
    participant F as Duels feature handler
    participant T as Table Storage
    participant S as DuelHub (SignalR)

    Judge->>C: models + prompt
    C->>B: POST /api/duels (cookie + correlation headers)
    B->>F: authenticated
    F->>T: insert Duel
    F-->>C: 202 Accepted
    F->>S: background inference streams tokens
    S-->>C: ModelStatusUpdate ... DuelComplete
    Judge->>B: POST verdict
    B->>F: authenticated
    F->>T: Elo update (ETag-safe)
    F-->>Judge: 200 + Elo shift
